# Supper for Spiders {1}{B}: the cards it returns "are Food artifacts", which is what they ENTER as (CR 614.12), so what watches
# artifacts entering sees them. Bot1's Tezzeret, Cruel Captain ("Whenever an artifact you control enters, put a loyalty counter on
# Tezzeret") is cast on turn 1 for Black Lotus's {B}{B}{B}, at 4 loyalty; the Mox Jet cast after it is an artifact entering: 5. On
# turn 3 Fatal Push (paid with the Jet's {B} through a Dark Ritual's {B}{B}{B}) destroys Bot2's Ornithopter, and Supper for Spiders
# (the other {B}{B}) returns it under Bot1's control as a Food artifact that enters untapped: Tezzeret gets a sixth counter. Bot2's
# Memnite is still on the battlefield, so Tezzeret did not see it.

